      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n- <Subject 1>: A anthropomorphic feline operative featuring dark grey fur with blue-and-magenta bioluminescent facial markings, vibrant purple hair, curled ram-like dark metallic horns, piercing light-blue eyes, and a bright teal nose, dressed in a sleek black suit jacket, white collared shirt, and black necktie, wielding a suppressed handgun. Linked to <Picture 2>, <Picture 3>, <Picture 4>, <Picture 5>, <Picture 6>, <Picture 7>, and <Picture 8>.\n\nsummary:\nA high-suspense, 90s-style cinematic thriller scene following <Subject 1> navigating a dark industrial stairwell, cautiously peering around corners with a suppressed pistol, establishing tense tactical movement and covert progression across eight continuous segments guided by <Picture 1> through <Picture 8>.\n\nretention_analysis:\nMaintain absolute visual consistency for <Subject 1>'s distinctive feline features, purple hair, horns, suit attire, and suppressed pistol across all dynamic action. Preserve the gritty, moody 90s thriller lighting and industrial concrete block architecture throughout all transitions.\n\ndetailed_description:\nTimeline:\n[00.00s-01.21s]:\n[VISUAL]: [Shot 1] The frame opens on a dark, closed wooden door filling the screen, matching <Picture 1>. Heavy rain pours down the surface. Slowly, the heavy door swings inward from left to right, revealing a sliver of warm light and disclosing <Subject 1> peering cautiously from behind the opening frame, transitioning into <Picture 2>.\n[SOUNDS]: Sound of a creaking wood door opening against falling rain.\n\n[01.21s-02.46s]:\n[VISUAL]: [Shot 2] Close-up shot tracking <Subject 1> as they lean past the doorframe, matching <Picture 3>. <Subject 1>'s purple-tufted ears twitch alertness and their bright blue eyes scan the hallway intensely, rain glistening on their dark fur and jacket shoulders.\n[SOUNDS]: Soft, wet footsteps and intense breathing, rain dampening in the background.\n\n[02.46s-05.30s]:\n[VISUAL]: [Shot 3] Medium-wide tracking shot along a stark concrete block stairwell as <Subject 1> crouches low behind metal pipe handrails, matching <Picture 4>. Holding a suppressed pistol in a two-handed tactical grip, <Subject 1> moves silently up the steps toward an open doorway labeled \"ВХОД\".\n[SOUNDS]: Squeak of rubber-soled boots on wet concrete, rustle of suit jacket fabric.\n\n[05.30s-06.55s]:\n[VISUAL]: <Subject 1> pivots fluidly into a defensive stance, leaning low against the rusted metal railing in the stairwell, matching <Picture 5>. Holding the suppressed handgun close to their chest, <Subject 1> glances sharply back down the steps to verify the area is clear.\n[SOUNDS]: Metallic clink of gun frame against suit buttons, faint distant echo.\n\n[06.55s-07.80s]:\n[VISUAL]: [Shot 4] Low-angle shot looking up at <Subject 1> descending a spiral stone staircase, matching <Picture 6>. <Subject 1> rests one gloved hand on the iron rail while keeping the raised, suppressed pistol ready, their plush purple-and-cyan tail swaying for balance.\n[SOUNDS]: Rhythmic, careful footsteps descending stone stairs.\n\n[07.80s-10.84s]:\n[VISUAL]: [Shot 5] Tight close-up frame as <Subject 1> presses firmly against a rough concrete wall corner, matching <Picture 7>. Holding the suppressor near face level, <Subject 1> slowly edges forward to peer into the dark corridor beyond.\n[SOUNDS]: Low rustle of suit fabric against rough concrete.\n\n[10.84s-12.10s]:\n[VISUAL]: Extreme close-up of <Subject 1> leaning around the wall corner, matching <Picture 8>. Light catches the sharp texture of <Subject 1>'s dark fur, purple hair bangs, and bright teal nose as their blue eyes widen slightly upon spotting a target ahead.\n[SOUNDS]: Soft, tense intake of breath.\n\n[12.10s-12.30s]:\n[VISUAL]: <Subject 1> quickly raises the suppressed pistol flush with their line of sight, fingers tightening on the grip as they prepare to take action, locking focus directly down the hallway.\n[SOUNDS]: Sharp metallic click of a handgun hammer cocking.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nAn immersive 90s atmospheric suspense soundscape featuring heavy rain external ambiance fading into echoing indoor concrete stairwell reverberations, subtle boot scrapes, suit fabric rustles, and precise mechanical weapon handling audio.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA low, pulsing synthesizer bassline paired with slow, rhythmic percussion to build escalating cinematic tension typical of a 1990s neo-noir action thriller."
      ],
